  "details": "The `Resolver` class within the package initializes on load and checks whether a window should be opened, this code executes on Unity's worker processes as well and due to a Unity bug calling `ShowWindow` causes it to open uninteractable white windows on the worker processes.\n\nThis can be resolved by aborting execution when `AssetDatabase.IsAssetImportWorkerProcess()` returns `true`.",
